# Amazon Sales Analysis Dashboard | Power BI

## Project Overview
This project focuses on analyzing Amazon sales data using Power BI to understand sales performance, product categories, customer purchasing patterns, and revenue trends.

## Tools Used
- Microsoft Power BI
- Microsoft Excel

## Project Objectives
- Analyze sales and revenue performance.
- Explore product categories and sales distribution.
- Identify top-performing products.
- Track sales trends and key performance indicators.
- Present business insights through an interactive dashboard.

## Project Workflow
1. Reviewed and prepared the dataset.
2. Cleaned and transformed data, if required.
3. Created charts, visualizations, and KPIs.
4. Designed an interactive Power BI dashboard.
5. Analyzed the results to identify useful business insights.

## Key Insights
- Analyzed sales performance across product categories.
- Explored revenue patterns and product trends.
- Identified important sales metrics from the dashboard.

